Package: proxmox-amlogic-kernel-runtime
Version: 1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: systemd
Maintainer: r0bb10
Description: Runtime cleanup support for Proxmox Amlogic kernels
 Installs the post-boot cleanup service used by custom Proxmox kernels
 on the X96 Max+ U-Boot boot layout.
